**Bounded Context划分**:
```
┌─────────────────┐   ┌─────────────────┐   ┌─────────────────┐
│  Order Context  │   │ Inventory Context│   │ Payment Context │
│  ───────────────│   │ ─────────────────│   │ ────────────────│
│  Order Aggregate│   │ Product Aggregate│   │ Payment Aggregate│
│  OrderItem      │   │ StockLevel       │   │ Transaction     │
│  Customer       │   │ Warehouse        │   │ Account         │
└─────────────────┘   └─────────────────┘   └─────────────────┘
        ↓                     ↓                      ↓
    OrderPlaced         InventoryUpdated       PaymentCompleted
        └──────────────────────┴──────────────────────┘
                        Domain Events
```
**Order Aggregate设计**:
```java
// 聚合根
class Order {
    private OrderId id;           // Entity身份
    private CustomerId customerId;
    private List<OrderItem> items; // 内部对象
    private OrderStatus status;
    // 业务方法（不暴露setter）
    public void addItem(Product product, int quantity) {
        if (status != OrderStatus.DRAFT) {
            throw new OrderCannotBeModifiedException();
        }
        items.add(new OrderItem(product, quantity));
    }
    public void place() {
        if (items.isEmpty()) {
            throw new OrderMustHaveItemsException();
        }
        status = OrderStatus.PLACED;
        // 发布领域事件
        DomainEvents.publish(new OrderPlaced(this.id));
    }
}
// 值对象
class OrderItem {
    private ProductId productId;
    private Money price;
    private int quantity;
    // 不可变，相等性基于属性
}
```

```java
// 错误：贫血实体
class Order {
    private String id;
    private String status;
    private List<OrderItem> items;
    // 只有getter/setter，无业务方法
}
// 错误：业务逻辑在Service层
class OrderService {
    public void addItem(Order order, Product product, int qty) {
        order.getItems().add(new OrderItem(product, qty));
    }
    public void placeOrder(Order order) {
        if (order.getItems().isEmpty()) {
            throw new RuntimeException("Order must have items");
        }
        order.setStatus("PLACED");
        orderRepository.save(order);
    }
}
// 问题：Order不保护自己的完整性，逻辑分散
